# Fields, separated by tabs: kind, title, holds, section, place, text
important	Important	code=1	Configure liveness health checks when creating or updating an app	body	The health check configuration that you provide with cf push overrides any configuration in the app manifest.
important	Important	code=1	Configure liveness health checks for an existing app	body	After you set the health check configuration of a deployed app with the cf set-health-check command, you must restart the app for the change to take effect.
important	Important	-	Health check types	table	To prevent false negatives, use a dedicated endpoint for health checks where response time and result do not depend on business logic.
important	Important	code=1	Health check HTTP endpoints	body	For HTTP apps, Cloud Foundry recommends setting the health check type to http instead of a simple port check.
